### Generate Event Description in AI Studio
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ai/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <ORGANIZER_TOKEN>

{
  "type": "event-description",
  "title": "FutureTech India 2027",
  "theme": "AI and Business Transformation",
  "audience": "Corporate professionals & Enterprise Architects",
  "category": "Artificial Intelligence",
  "keyTopics": "Agentic Workflows, Scalable LLMs, Enterprise Security"
}

### Get AI Session Recommendations
GET http://localhost:5000/api/ai/recommendations/66d000000000000000000001
Authorization: Bearer <ATTENDEE_TOKEN>
